      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "With a firm grasp on it in both hands, I gather\r\nall my strength, concentrate and swing down!!\r\nIt is a moment of ecstasy so intense that I feel\r\nthe world revolves around my arms.",
